><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Striking visuals with a day-night system, different weather seasons, all rendered in 3D.<br></li><li>Randomly generated levels. You'll get different levels each time you visit an area.<br></li><li>Customize Weapons: Create your custom weapons by changing weapon components found throughout the game.<br></li><li>Unique locations: Choose your next location in the world map. Locations include: indoor labs, churches, old abandoned cities, and forest.<br></li><li>Combat: Choose your combat style by upgrading your character.<br></li><li>Exploration: Uncover hidden secrets and accomplish quests though-out the Anord' environment.<br></li><li>Inventory: Build up your inventory with many different item types, weapons, ammo, components, etc.</li></ul>",
